NNAAMMEE
       cciss - HP Smart Array block driver

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
       modprobe cciss [ cciss_allow_hpsa=1 ]

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       NNoottee:  This  obsolete driver was removed in Linux 4.14, as it is super‐
       seded by the hhppssaa(4) driver in newer kernels.

       cccciissss is a block driver for older HP Smart Array RAID controllers.

