   CCoonnffiigguurraattiioonn ddeettaaiillss
       To configure HP Smart Array controllers, use the HP Array Configuration
       Utility  (either  hhppaaccuuxxee(8)  or  hhppaaccuuccllii(8)) or the Offline ROM‐based
       Configuration Utility (ORCA) run from the Smart Array’s option  ROM  at
       boot time.

